Package: trama.publicar
Title: Publish trama Flows as Reproducible Research Packages
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Mambelli Fernandes", , "pedromambelli@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Packages a trama flow, the results linked to it and its models
    (without training data) as an RO-Crate, with a Quarto page where models
    predict in the browser through WebR, and a local preview.
